  "releaseNotes": "The main window gets a status bar that hosts can fill, with the product version in a fixed slot. Role changes for a stored user are saved right away, Switch User shows accounts as cards, and debug tools move to the top of the Tools list. Scroll bars and unselected tab captions now follow the light and dark theme.\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.7/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Ui.Wpf.Core/0.1.0-alpha.7.md",
